r mall to avoid going bankrupt.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mall Opening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/d58b01cd30e71888260e33ce89d8f859297ffb9e.jpg"},{"name":"10th Receipt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/b9125cce339586c6fe0a875128ac0b86140b224d.jpg"},{"name":"Leveled up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/49fd858ab442e3bdbba35fe130ff5e66ff715b5a.jpg"},{"name":"Store No. 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/a7af7d9a64ea3af51957eff423e2831b418697d6.jpg"},{"name":"Brand New Deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/c71fcc6baf3002c9d690c3d83c2785f6124c70f3.jpg"},{"name":"Foot in the Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/e308b4d5c16df52777850c86fd0062ff05ccebaf.jpg"},{"name":"Pocket Change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/f7b933719d3aa66111a3212b9333e7f84ecabcd0.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3 Luster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/0a9ca28754253a7271cc4796345ff3a9af58f144.jpg"},{"name":"Crowded Halls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/d9159ddb140b4190ffc63e92c485739194cd8988.jpg"},{"name":"Growth Spurt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180150/bd107783ba7b432e9a2b931e0c0d9b0b036b2947.jpg"}],"total":70},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180150?t=1773323848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180150?t=1773323848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/04788c2d2771d9d5c5bf7090bb6e805b00767e36/capsule