 design for your mall and manage your stores. Showcase your best-seller stores and create the perfect mall for your customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.poster.avif?t=1773323848\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.webm?t=1773323848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.mp4?t=1773323848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/c84ee29304b617e78002eae935b2c663.avif?t=1773323848\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Zero to hero! Open new stores of the most famous brands and sell their products in your mall. Expand your stores in the mall from a grocery to a jewellery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ddfd6444237d33b76b3d415003d410.poster.avif?t=1773323848\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ddfd6444237d33b76b3d415003d410.webm?t=1773323848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ddfd6444237d33b76b3d415003d410.mp4?t=1773323848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf40307ad0470cd44fbdd0ded1d71dc3.avif?t=177332